# NOTE: state/history_deep, state/history, state/intraday are now COMMITTED so the repo
# is self-contained for Vercel (which serves the checkout, not an Actions-built _site).
# They're regenerated each cycle and re-committed by publish.py, which stages them with a
# state-scoped `git add -A -- state/` (NOT a blanket add). Deltas are tiny (deep history
# only appends the latest bar), so history bloat stays modest.
logs/
# Anchored to the repo root ON PURPOSE. This ignores the terminal's Vercel build
# output (root vercel.json does `mkdir -p public`). An unanchored `public/` also
# matches site/public/, which silently kept robots.txt, favicon.svg and the OG
# image out of the marketing build — they 404'd on the live site.
/public/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
.venv/
# never commit secrets
.env
*.key
# .github/workflows/ IS tracked now (the gh token needs 'workflow' scope to push it;
# it currently lives on GitHub via the web UI — keep the two in sync manually)

# scratch diff dumps - internal noise, never ship
full_diff.txt

# Tooling scaffolding dropped into the tree by the PostHog wizard (2026-07-22).
# Neither is part of either Vercel build. publish.py no longer does a blanket
# `git add -A` (fixed 2026-07-19 / 2026-07-26 — it stages state/ and GENERATED by
# path), but these stay ignored so a hand-typed `git add .` can't quietly carry
# ~90KB of vendor docs into a code release — the accident documented in
# docs/OPERATIONS.md section 2a.
_analytics/
site/.claude/

# Firecrawl CLI scratch output (insider-disclosure scrape intermediates) — never ship
.firecrawl/
.proto-tmp/

# Local scratch caches. Nothing under .cache/ is ever shipped.
.cache/

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
graft/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent scratch working trees (added 2026-09-05).
#
# .codex-* are GIT WORKTREES of this same repo created by Codex sessions — each
# `.git` is a pointer file, not a repository, so they share one object store and
# their branches already live in .git/refs. The checked-out files are still ~12 GB
# on disk and must never appear as untracked noise in `git status`.
#
# IMPORTANT: never `rm -rf` one of these. That leaves a stale entry in the
# worktree registry. Use `git worktree remove <dir>` (or `git worktree prune`
# after the fact). `git worktree list` shows what is currently registered.
.codex-*/
.claude/worktrees/

# Ad-hoc QA / design comparison checkouts.
.qa-*/

# Node + Astro build artefacts and package caches — regenerable, never committed.
node_modules/
.astro/
.pnpm-store/

# Marketing/video scratch: HuggingFace starter scaffold and intro-video working dirs.
_hf-starter/
henneth-intro-video/
henneth-intro-hyperframes/

# Stray local debug dump.
debug.log
